    <textarea class="input w-full resize-none text-sm leading-relaxed" data-test="ai-prompt" readonly="" rows="5" value="Please help me connect "Claude Code" to Hiyo. The endpoint is https://codex.hiyo.top and the API format is Anthropic. It needs the environment variables ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL (the endpoint) and ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN (the key). They can also go in the env section of ~/.claude/settings.json. I will enter the key myself, so please do not ask me to send it to you. Docs: https://docs.example.com" :value="Please help me connect \\"Claude Code\\" to Hiyo. The endpoint is https://codex.hiyo.top and the API format is Anthropic. It needs the environment variables ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL (the endpoint) and ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN (the key). They can also go in the env section of ~/.claude/settings.json. I will enter the key myself, so please do not ask me to send it to you. Docs: https://docs.example.com">
