  复制简短版 = "Please help me connect \\"Chat app\\" to Hiyo. The endpoint is https://codex.hiyo.top/antigravity and the API format is Anthropic. It needs a custom provider added in the app's settings, using the Anthropic-compatible type, with the endpoint and key filled in and the model names added by hand. I will enter the key myself, so please do not ask me to send it to you. Docs: https://docs.example.com"
