第一个客户端的详细版全文:
Please walk me through connecting "Claude Code" to Hiyo, step by step.

- Endpoint: https://codex.hiyo.top/antigravity
- API format: Anthropic
- Key: I will enter it myself. Do not ask me for it or have me paste it into the chat.
- Available models: claude-opus-5, gemini-3-pro

It needs the environment variables ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL (the endpoint) and ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN (the key). They can also go in the env section of ~/.claude/settings.json.

First ask which operating system I use, then tell me which file to change and how. Remind me to back up the existing config before changing it, and show me one simple command to check that it works.
Docs: https://docs.example.com"
`;

exports[`KeyOnboardingModal 页签快照 > 'antigravity' > ccswitch 页签 1`] = `
"### DOM
<div aria-labelledby="onboarding-N-tab-ccswitch" class="onb-card space-y-4" data-test="panel-ccswitch" id="onboarding-N-panel-ccswitch" role="tabpanel">
 <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
  <div>
   <span class="input-label" id="onboarding-N-ccs-client">
    "Client"
   <div aria-label="Client" aria-labelledby="onboarding-N-ccs-client" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" role="radiogroup">
    <button aria-checked="true" class="onb-chip onb-chip-active" data-test="ccs-client-claude" role="radio" type="button">
     "Claude"
    <button aria-checked="false" class="onb-chip" data-test="ccs-client-gemini" role="radio" type="button">
     "Gemini"
  <div class="">
   <label class="input-label" for="ccs-name">
    "Profile name"
   <input class="input" data-test="ccs-name" id="ccs-name" placeholder="Hiyo - Claude" type="text" :value="">
  <div class="sm:col-span-2">
   <label class="input-label" for="ccs-model">
    "Model"
   <select class="input" data-test="ccs-model" id="ccs-model" :value="">
    <option value="">
     "Default"
    <option value="claude-opus-5">
     "claude-opus-5"
    <option value="gemini-3-pro">
     "gemini-3-pro"
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
  <button class="btn btn-primary" data-test="ccs-open" type="button">
   "Open CC Switch"
  <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-test="ccs-copy-link" type="button">
   "Copy import link"
 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-400">
  "Nothing happened? Install CC Switch first, then click again."
  <a class="font-medium text-primary-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary-400" href="https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
   "Download CC Switch"

