      "Your key is filled in below"
     <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800" data-test="manual-code-openai-python">
       <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 dark:border-dark-700">
        <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-dark-400">
