        <button class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-gray-600 transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-500 dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-dark-700 dark:hover:text-white" type="button">
         <span class="text-xs">
          "Copy"
       <pre class="overflow-x-auto bg-gray-900 px-4 py-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-gray-100 dark:bg-dark-950">
        "# pip install openai\\nfrom openai import OpenAI\\n\\nclient = OpenAI(\\n    base_url=\\"https://codex.hiyo.top/v1\\",\\n    api_key=\\"sk-SECRET-1234567890abcdef\\",\\n)\\n\\nresp = client.chat.completions.create(\\n    model=\\"gpt-5.6-sol\\",\\n    messages=[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"Hello\\"}],\\n)\\nprint(resp.choices[0].message.content)"
    <div>
     <p class="mb-2 font-serif text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
      "Save it in a config file"
     <div class="space-y-2">
      <details class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800">
       <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
        "Codex CLI"
       <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800">
         <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 dark:border-dark-700">
          <span class="font-mono min-w-0 truncate text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-dark-400">
           "~/.codex/config.toml"
          <button class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-gray-600 transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-500 dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-dark-700 dark:hover:text-white" type="button">
           <span class="text-xs">
            "Copy"
         <pre class="overflow-x-auto bg-gray-900 px-4 py-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-gray-100 dark:bg-dark-950">
          "model_provider = \\"hiyo\\"\\nmodel = \\"gpt-5.6-sol\\"\\n\\n[model_providers.hiyo]\\nname = \\"Hiyo\\"\\nbase_url = \\"https://codex.hiyo.top/v1\\"\\nwire_api = \\"responses\\"\\nrequires_openai_auth = false\\nexperimental_bearer_token = \\"sk-SECRET-1234567890abcdef\\""
      <details class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800">
       <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
        "OpenCode"
       <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800">
         <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 dark:border-dark-700">
          <span class="font-mono min-w-0 truncate text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-dark-400">
           "~/.config/opencode/opencode.json"
          <button class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-gray-600 transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-500 dark:border-dark-700 dark:bg-dark-800 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-dark-700 dark:hover:text-white" type="button">
           <span class="text-xs">
            "Copy"
         <pre class="overflow-x-auto bg-gray-900 px-4 py-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-gray-100 dark:bg-dark-950">
          "{\\n  \\"$schema\\": \\"https://opencode.ai/config.json\\",\\n  \\"provider\\": {\\n    \\"openai\\": {\\n      \\"options\\": {\\n        \\"baseURL\\": \\"https://codex.hiyo.top/v1\\",\\n        \\"apiKey\\": \\"sk-SECRET-1234567890abcdef\\"\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}"
    <div>
     <p class="mb-2 font-serif text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
      "If it will not connect"
     <ul class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 marker:text-gray-300 dark:text-dark-400 dark:marker:text-dark-600">
      <li>
       "Do not add extra slashes to the address. OpenAI-compatible clients need an address ending in /v1."
      <li>
       "Copy the whole key, with no spaces or line breaks around it."
      <li>
       "Restart the client after changing its config."
      <li>
       "Check that your network or proxy can reach the endpoint, and update the client if it is old."
    <a class="inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-primary-700 hover:underline dark:text-primary-400" href="https://docs.example.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
     "View docs"
    <p class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-3 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:border-dark-700 dark:text-dark-400" data-test="manual-footer">
     "Keep your key safe. Anyone who has it can spend your balance or plan."

