第一个客户端的详细版全文:
Please walk me through connecting "Chat app" to Hiyo, step by step.

- Endpoint: https://codex.hiyo.top
- API format: Anthropic
- Key: I will enter it myself. Do not ask me for it or have me paste it into the chat.

It needs a custom provider added in the app's settings, using the Anthropic-compatible type, with the endpoint and key filled in and the model names added by hand.

First ask which operating system I use, then tell me which file to change and how. Remind me to back up the existing config before changing it, and show me one simple command to check that it works.
Docs: https://docs.example.com"
`;

